sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant ExtractionService
    participant DocumentAI
    participant Textract
    participant Gemini
    participant Redis

    Client->>ExtractionService: Upload PDF
    ExtractionService->>Redis: check cache(hash)
    alt cache hit
        Redis-->>ExtractionService: cached JSON
        ExtractionService-->>Client: structured JSON
    else cache miss
        ExtractionService->>DocumentAI: process document
        DocumentAI-->>ExtractionService: structured result + confidence
        alt low confidence
            ExtractionService->>Textract: fallback OCR
            Textract-->>ExtractionService: fallback result
        end
        ExtractionService->>Gemini: normalize tables & sections
        Gemini-->>ExtractionService: normalized JSON
        ExtractionService->>Redis: set cache(hash, JSON)
        ExtractionService-->>Client: structured JSON
    end
